{"data": [{"author_id": "2013436454773379072", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:54:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113449061298610608"], "id": "2113449061298610608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 321, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113447501877358629", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "从\"我们\"到\"我\"\n\n一组数据，看清这个时代的变化：\n\n2026 年上半年，全国结婚登记 327.5 万对，同比下降约 7.46%，是 2014 年以来同期最低。\n2025 年全年出生人口 792 万，创 1949 年以来新低。\n全国平均每个家庭户只有 2.52 人。\n\n消费也跟着变了：两个人的生意在退潮，取悦自己的生意在崛起。 https://t.co/ofm45lPbrp", "url": "https://x.com/TaoLongevity/status/2113449061298610608"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113527290621825024"]}, "author_id": "2869390354", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:05:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113527308598587696"], "id": "2113527308598587696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 472, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人口：生育率跌到 1.0\n\n维持人口不减少，平均每位女性需要生 2.1 个孩子。中国的总和生育率：\n\n1990 年 2.51\n\n2015 年 1.67\n\n2023 年 1.00，2024 年 1.01\n\n已经低于日本（1.15），只比全世界最低的韩国（0.75）高。美国是 1.63。\n\n后果已经显现：\n\n中国总人口从 2022 年起连续下降，2025 年约 https://t.co/9ebnKg7Iap", "url": "https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2113527308598587696"}, {"author_id": "2098622172860182536", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:05:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113496996145176803"], "id": "2113496996145176803", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 182, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国社保真正的大雷，可能不是老龄化，而是几十年前的一笔历史欠账。\n\n1997年，朱镕基任副总理期间，中国建立统一的企业职工基本养老保险制度，开始全面推进社会统筹加个人账户。\n\n问题是，很多老职工以前根本没交过养老保险，退休后却需要领取养老金。这笔历史转轨成本，最后还是得有人承担。", "url": "https://x.com/nibnnnn/status/2113496996145176803"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113134053205635072", "3_2113134108205629440", "3_2113134157404786688", "3_2113134189109489664"]}, "author_id": "1260553941714186241", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113374841529045258"], "id": "2113374841529045258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 176, "impression_count": 106767, "like_count": 635, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 35, "retweet_count": 64}, "text": "六张图解读中国经济：出口繁荣难掩内需疲软、房市低迷与人口萎缩\n\n10月21日彭博社报道，中国政府将2026年经济增长目标下调至4.5%至5%，为1991年以来最低目标。彭博社以六组图表剖析当前中国经济深层矛盾。 https://t.co/R9X8jZiJiG", "url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113374841529045258"}, {"author_id": "116251267", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:31:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113488468269760525"], "id": "2113488468269760525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Humans have achieved a weird situation where wealth is inversely correlated with fertility. Wild animals don’t have money, but they have as many babies as they can. Poor people in shithole countries have higher TFR than the richest nation in history. Odd, that.", "url": "https://x.com/EleganteStache/status/2113488468269760525"}, {"article": {"title": "裤论 | 欧洲的意外死亡 "}, "author_id": "1516262944534892549", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:07:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113422095787143585"], "id": "2113422095787143585", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 3065, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "https://t.co/fJxLSrwRe0", "url": "https://x.com/Zealots2022/status/2113422095787143585"}, {"author_id": "2030265052360765440", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:41:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113415588949414370"], "id": "2113415588949414370", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "给孩子选学习平板后，我开始重新思考：AI时代，教育到底该怎么变？\n\n最近在给孩子挑选学习平板，研究了不少产品，发现一个挺有意思的现象。", "url": "https://x.com/ChenChaim42853/status/2113415588949414370"}, {"article": {"title": "出口撑起的 